      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the Hotel Saint-Georges, the receptionist asks Andréa and Gabriel to wait for the manager. They want his help with Samuel's private room, but Colette arrives before they can speak to him. First, listen in French.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce qu'on va lui dire?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Il nous aide, ou on arrête d'envoyer nos clients ici.",
      "gap": 0.55
