      "t": "'What? Who is there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "C'est Brancillon! Elle sait déjà tout pour la chambre!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's Brancillon! She already knows everything about the room!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Bonjour, Madame Brancillon.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Ms Brancillon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "andrea",
      "t": "Ce n'est pas ce que vous croyez.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's not what you think.'",
